cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AREE, please cite it as below."
title: "AREE — Aquaculture Resilience Evidence Engine"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible research resource that converts fragmented public omics
  datasets into harmonized, comparable resilience-biomarker evidence for Pacific
  oyster (Crassostrea gigas) and other aquaculture organisms, via standardized
  reanalysis, cross-study harmonization, and meta-analysis.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-org/AREE"
keywords:
  - aquaculture
  - Crassostrea gigas
  - resilience
  - biomarker
  - meta-analysis
  - reproducibility
  - bioinformatics
authors:
  - name: "AREE contributors"
